<title>USA: IPO FILING - Total Entertainment Restaurant Corp.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING - Total Entertainment Restaurant Corp.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name		   Total Entertainment Restaurant Corp</p>
<p>Stock symbol			TENT.O</p>
<p>Estimated price range	   $9-$11/shr</p>
<p>Total shares to be offered    2.0 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by company	 2.0 million</p>
<p>Shrs outstanding after ipo    10,000,000</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter		 Montgomery Securities</p>
<p>Underwriters over-allotment  300,000 shrs Business: Based in Dallas, Tx., the company owns and operates 12 entertainment restaurant locations under the Fox &amp; Hound and Bailey's Sports Grille brand names. Use of Proceeds: To finance the expansion and development of additional entertainment restaurant locations, to repay indebtedness and for general corporate purposes. Financial Data: N/A</p>
</text>
